# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Darkshore

step Kerlonian Evershade
  zone Darkshore
  tip From Auberdine follow the road south. Kerlonian sleeps at the Grove of the Ancients in southern Darkshore. Use the Horn of Awakening to wake him and lead him south along the road into Ashenvale to Liladris Moonriver at Maestra's Post; blow the horn again whenever he falls asleep.
  tip Careful: Scripted ambushes of three mobs each attack along the road: furbolgs on the Darkshore stretch and undead nearer Maestra's Post.
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Grove of the Ancients"
  accept 5321                                 -- Kerlonian Evershade
  collect 13536 quest 5321.1                  -- Kerlonian's Chest, beside him
  goto 44.4,76.4 "Kerlonian Evershade"
  note Escort Kerlonian to Maestra's Post in Ashenvale.

step Ashenvale
  zone Ashenvale
  goto 26.2,38.7 "Ashenvale"

