# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Stonetalon Mountains

step Stonetalon Mountains
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  goto 71.9,60.0 "Stonetalon Mountains"

step Piznik
  tip Piznik mines in the Windshear Mine at the east end of the crag. Talk to him and fend off the Venture Co. raiders while he mines.
  tip Careful: The kobolds arrive in waves. The first wave is melee fighters, and the second adds casters to the mix. Regular mobs in the mine respawn quickly and can join the fight while the waves are coming. A group is recommended.
  accept 1090                         -- Below ground
  complete 1090
  turnin 1090
  accept 1092

step Windshear Crag
  zone Stonetalon Mountains
  tip Head south past Mystral Lake into the Talondeep Path tunnel; it comes out in Stonetalon's Windshear Crag. Kaela and Gaxim camp on the Webwinder Path south-west of the crag.
  turnin 1070                             -- Kaela Shadowspear
  accept 1085
  turnin 1085                             -- Gaxim Rustfizzle
  accept 1071

